<p>You do not have to merchandize six brands on day one. A custom shop or a dealer leaving Kraftmaid, Medallion, Omega, StarMark, UltraCraft, Bellmont, or Canyon Creek usually opens <a href="/guides/become-a-shiloh-dealer/">Shiloh</a> and stops there until the floor earns the next line. The six public brands exist so you can grow without a second rep firm.</p>

<h2>The six public brands</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry/">Shiloh</a></strong> — Face-frame and inset. The usual first line. WW Wood, Dudley, Missouri. Custom paint, six inset styles, ~6-week lead.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">Eclipse</a></strong> — Frameless full-access. Same factory, same door styles and finishes as Shiloh, comparable price.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry/">Aspect</a></strong> — Value semi-custom for builders and tighter bids. Same WW Wood build quality, fewer options.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/vistora-closets/">Vistora</a></strong> — Pre-assembled closet modules from WW Wood. Whole-home ticket without a second closet vendor.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens/">Pronorm</a></strong> — German fitted kitchens, nationwide, protected. Typical install $40,000–$150,000+. <a href="/guides/pronorm-american-depths/">American depths</a> for US rooms and appliances.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/us-stone-group/">US Stone</a></strong> — Luxury surfaces. Spec the box and the slab in one relationship.</li>
</ul>

<h2>What is not on this site</h2>
<p>Nevara is a dealer-only WW Wood SKU. It is not on this site. Do not pitch it from these pages.</p>

<h2>One partnership</h2>
<p>WW Wood lines are a 10-state Western map. Pronorm is nationwide. Check Shiloh on the form if that is the ask. Read <a href="/guides/protected-dealer-territories/">protected territories</a>, then <a href="/become-a-dealer/">apply</a>.</p>

